# Channel routing

Pass `--channel` explicitly. Do not infer mode from the title.

| Spoken name | `--channel` |
|---|---|
| What They Really Think | `what_they_really_think` |
| How They Really Make Money | `behind_the_business` (alias `how_they_really_make_money`) |
| How They Took Over | `how_they_took_over` |

Do not apply money-flow rules to a Think title, takeover flywheels to a money title, or muted historical portraits to a company documentary.

Playbooks: `docs/custom-videos.md`, `docs/behind-the-business.md`, `docs/how-they-took-over.md`.
